    {
      "page_id": "frieren_ch26_010",
      "line_id": "010_001",
      "page_order": 1,
      "source_text": "汚れ一つない白い外套はこの村最強の戦士の証。",
      "source_box": [
        452,
        321,
        582,
        484
      ],
      "block_id": "ocr_0001_23feea9b",
      "source_hash": "d871a3a6e3acad31",
      "reference_text": "That unsullied white cloak of yours is proof that you are the most powerful warrior of this village.",
      "alignment_confidence": "high",
      "reference_role": "speech",
      "skip_reference": false,
      "skip_reason": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "page_id": "frieren_ch26_010",
      "line_id": "010_002",
      "page_order": 2,
      "source_text": "シュトルツはこの村の誇りだ。",
      "source_box": [
        316,
        326,
        371,
        483
      ],
      "block_id": "ocr_0002_19b4125b",
      "source_hash": "52554529d339a81d",
      "reference_text": "You are the pride of this village, Stolz.",
      "alignment_confidence": "high",
      "reference_role": "speech",
      "skip_reference": false,
      "skip_reason": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "page_id": "frieren_ch26_010",
      "line_id": "010_003",
      "page_order": 3,
      "source_text": "当然だ親父。",
      "source_box": [
        46,
        502,
        113,
        576
      ],
      "block_id": "ocr_0003_cbe2329b",
      "source_hash": "8b0265a8f63b1ace",
      "reference_text": "Naturally, Father.",
      "alignment_confidence": "high",
      "reference_role": "speech",
      "skip_reference": false,
      "skip_reason": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "page_id": "frieren_ch26_010",
      "line_id": "010_004",
      "page_order": 4,
      "source_text": "それに比べてシュタルク。あいつは失敗作だ。",
      "source_box": [
        534,
        686,
        619,
        864
      ],
      "block_id": "ocr_0004_0e6f3130",
      "source_hash": "49b0da4fc25342e6",
      "reference_text": "And yet compared to you, there is Stark. He is a reject.",
      "alignment_confidence": "high",
      "reference_role": "speech",
      "skip_reference": false,
      "skip_reason": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "page_id": "frieren_ch26_010",
      "line_id": "010_005",
      "page_order": 5,
      "source_text": "毎日あれだけ修行しているというのに、",
      "source_box": [
        340,
        658,
        429,
        787
      ],
      "block_id": "ocr_0005_18185ba3",
      "source_hash": "03a3de6ebd385fae",
      "reference_text": "Even though he trains that much every day.",
      "alignment_confidence": "high",
      "reference_role": "speech",
      "skip_reference": false,
      "skip_reason": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "page_id": "frieren_ch26_010",
      "line_id": "010_006",
      "page_order": 6,
      "source_text": "まだ一度も魔物とまともに戦えていない。",
      "source_box": [
        52,
        658,
        145,
        807
      ],
      "block_id": "ocr_0006_287829aa",
      "source_hash": "4057d58624fb298e",
      "reference_text": "He is still unable to fight monsters seriously.",
